This image contains the weights of Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct (Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-GGUF, a GGUF
build at Q4_K_M with its Q8_0 vision projector) and Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct (ggml-org/Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct-GGUF,
Q8_0 with its Q8_0 vision projector), by the Qwen team at Alibaba Cloud (https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL),
unmodified, under the Apache License, Version 2.0, in /opt/qwen/models/LICENSE. Sources and checksums:
/opt/qwen/weights.lock. The image runs them only to transcribe the crops of the newspaper page in each
BOINC task; the model is a reader, not a judge, and its text is compared with the other readers' on the
project's server.
